WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Around eleven o'clock this morning

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:06,480
Chen Yundong was killed in front of the Xilaideng Hotel on Jiefang Road

3
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,240
Are you determined not to give up until you reach the Yellow River?

4
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,160
Do you want to force me? What should I force you to do?

5
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,880
I've been breaking into the house all the time

6
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,040
Tell me shit

7
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:14,600
Senior sister results show

8
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,640
Yang Jun died around five or six in the morning

9
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:19,120
Chen Yundong was dumped in Mihe River

10
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,520
You have to come out in a decent manner while causing trouble.

11
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,480
Who kills people in such a busy area?

12
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,440
Still at the door of a five-star hotel, I warn you

13
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:27,560
My patience is limited

14
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:29,980
I'll give you one last chance

15
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:31,700
You'd better tell me the truth

16
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:32,820
it's good for you

17
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:35,480
I tell you the truth, you may not be happy

18
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,880
The truth is that I didn’t kill Yang Jun

19
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:40,110
I don't know who killed him either.

20
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:44,390
Where and when was Captain Li killed? I am here today.

21
00:00:44,390 --> 00:00:45,710
It is my duty as a citizen

22
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:46,870
Same as last time

23
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:49,340
But you asked someone to catch me here today

24
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:51,180
He also treated me as a suspect and interrogated me.

25
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:52,980
I hope you can give me an explanation

26
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:55,320
I want you to come up with solid evidence

27
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,520
To prove that I am a suspect

28
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,620
if you can't take it out

29
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,080
I won't let this matter go.

30
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:03,700
You still threaten me

31
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:06,180
You want evidence, right? OK, then I'll give you the evidence.

32
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:07,620
You'd better think about it

33
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:08,940
what did you do last night

34
00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:10,420
Do you need it? Let me remind you. No need.

35
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:12,260
I never hide the things I've done

36
00:01:12,810 --> 00:01:14,250
I went to see Yang Jun last night

37
00:01:14,450 --> 00:01:16,130
And we were in a skewers shop with Yang Jun’s people

38
00:01:16,130 --> 00:01:18,450
A little friction occurred with the hands and feet of Captain Li

39
00:01:18,850 --> 00:01:20,170
Is this what you call evidence?

40
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:24,600
Did you say something to me that you wanted his life?

41
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:26,440
Then in the early morning of the next day he

42
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:28,360
That is, he was killed a few hours later.

43
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:30,120
Do you dare to say that this matter has nothing to do with you?
